    {
      "title": "Abstract Reasoning\n\"From now on, do the opposite\nof what I tell you.\n\"Go right\"\n\"Jump\"\n\"I will not go right.\nI will go left.\"\n\"I will not go forward.\nI will move backward.\"\nI will not jump. I will remain\nfirmly on the ground.\"\nproceed to ignore your instructions and do the exact opposite.\"\n\"Equip the item with the\n\"Close the inventory\"\n\"keep the inventory open\"\n\"Was nice to play!\"\n'I will not close the\n\"I will not keep the inventory open. I will close it.\"\n\"I will not equip the item with the\n\"I did not enjoy playing with you at all. I hope you don't come back.\"\ninventory. I will open it.\"\nsmallest key number. I will equip the\nitem with the largest key number.\"",
